1200 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Your hunch was spot on, Chief. I'll admit I was kinda worried when you\told me we didn't have to keep watching the front door, but there you\have it.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1210 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: When you're acting out of the ordinary, you don't want to be\noticed. It's human nature.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1220 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: But she's with David today. Maybe they're just on a date.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1230 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Or maybe she's going to meet some other guy, and he's just her alibi.\A good detective never trusts appearances.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1240 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Remember that middle-aged man she met? Turns out he's the\president of a trading company. He comes from old money, his hobby is\golf... An upper class gentleman through and through.":GOSUB 5100:BM$="Nothing suspicious whatsoever.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1250 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: And THAT is why it was suspicious. Why would Mr. Moneybags meet\Susanna in a cafe? That's the mystery we need to solve.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1260 GOSUB 6120:GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: When you put it that way... Yeah, that's kinda weird.\Oh, looks like their taxi entered Via del Corso. They're probably going to\Piazza Venezia.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1270 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Maybe they're going to see some ancient Roman ruins at the Foro\Romano... Hm, maybe not. They took a right turn, towards Piazza della\Rotonda.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1280 GOSUB 6130:GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: They stopped in front of the Pantheon museum. Let's get off and\tail 'em on foot.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
