1700 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: I think they're looking up... coats of arms?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1710 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Looks like it, but that handkerchief belongs to David. Susanna's only\here to help him.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1720 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Maybe they're looking for some cool design for a prop or something.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1730 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: I don't think so. If that's the coat of arms of David's family, it's\possible this whole European Tour was just a means to travel around\Europe and find more information about that crest's history.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1740 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Was there really a point in tailing Susanna today?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1750 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Why, you had anything better to do? Besides, she might leave him at\some point and go off on her own.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
